["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"143. 對何小鵬的第二次訪談：更大賭注、人形機器人Iron誕生、那場意外、技術劇變下CEO、GX和縫合怪 VLA 縫合怪 SOP T1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-28-zhangxiaojun-何小鹏-通用人形机器人99-99-会死-我们赌那两成胜率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/392e7ab9c3c64df9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0528</span></div>\n<h2>何小鵬：通用人形機器人99.99%會死，我們賭那兩成勝率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鵬把花了小几十億的自動駕駛體系整個停掉，因為用軟件方法論加AI工具箱做出來的只是「AI縫合怪」。他給通用人形機器人的勝率是兩成，而機器人創業難度是造車的20到100倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"142. 雨森的創投觀察第2集：Harness、下一個字節、2026大機會和Stanley Druckenmiller Harness context engineering sandbox out of distribution agency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-27-zhangxiaojun-harness-才是操作系统-模型只是插拔的处理器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38abc82541e9f530-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:18:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0527</span></div>\n<h2>Harness 才是操作系統，模型只是插拔的處理器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司做的是提煉基礎油的煉油廠，真正值錢的是化工廠和汽車公司。用戶對 Harness 更忠誠——他會換模型，但不想換掉存著自己記憶的那個殼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 應用</span><span class=\"tag\">Harness</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"141. Freda的投資札記第2集：Tokenmaxxing、把電機塞進蒸汽機、接力賽變籃球賽、孤獨、人的連接 Tokenmaxxing recursive self-improvement economic diffusion Neo Labs Acquire Hire\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-18-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代最稀缺的不是信息-是有人味的对话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86731af431732da4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0518</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代最稀缺的不是信息，是有人味的對話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當 90% 到 95% 的信息性內容都能直接問 AI 拿到，以信息交換為目的的對話正在被掏空，人和人之間剩下的只有情感連接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投資</span><span class=\"tag\">模型公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"139. 【Agent的綜述】和蘇煜聊Agent技術史、OpenClaw Moment、邊界的消弭和社會的輻射 semantic parsing language agent world model continual learning cortical column non-parametric learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-01-zhangxiaojun-agent-的瓶颈不是智能-是它学不会成为专家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frae4ewVVYvZrX2W21CxXNLzUVmk.jpg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:17:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0501</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 的瓶頸不是智能，是它學不會成為專家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">通用智能已經夠用且廉價，真正稀缺的是 specialized intelligence——讓 agent 像實習生變成老師傅那樣，持續學會某個小世界的 world model。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">持續學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"136. 全球大模型季報第9集：和廣密聊，Coding是AGI第二幕、硅谷御三家真相、模型正成為新一代OS Harness Engineering Token Usage Solta model feedback loop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-14-zhangxiaojun-coding-是-agi-第二幕-没有领先的-coding-模型就像没有领先的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6add56ae20b47c40-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0414</span></div>\n<h2>Coding 是 AGI 第二幕：沒有領先的 Coding 模型就像沒有領先的 GPU</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司真正的分水嶺不是 C 端 DAU，而是能不能組織幾百個最聰明的人 all in 做數據這件髒活——Anthropic 贏在戰略專注，OpenAI 輸在什麼都想要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Coding</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ferrari Tifosi Classiche Purosangue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-13-acquired-法拉利-卖的不是车-是排他与包容的悖论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b28a1307f172ac6a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:59:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0413</span></div>\n<h2>法拉利年產1.4萬輛，市值卻超福特：賣的是排他，也是包容</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法拉利年產僅1.4萬輛，市值卻超福特。秘訣在於同時擁有奢侈品的排他性和運動隊的包容性，用稀缺性製造神話，用社群維持忠誠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法拉利</span><span class=\"tag\">奢侈品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"135. 和自然選擇創始人Tristan聊，Elys、賽博分身、靈魂、Context的獲取與流動和AI社交網絡 Context Proactive Agentic 商增\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-10-zhangxiaojun-ai时代唯一重要的事是做自己-社交网络要被重做一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/219fe489c3e71f04-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0410</span></div>\n<h2>AI時代唯一重要的事是做自己，社交網絡要被重做一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tristan 認為 AI 時代唯一重要的事是構建主體性——把 context 沉澱下來，讓 AI 替你做社交裡最無聊的商增，人只接管最重要的連接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI社交</span><span class=\"tag\">Context</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"134. 【數據的綜述】和謝晨聊，新時代的石油、歷史、版圖、數據金字塔、定價與Recipe Sim-to-Real Shadow Mode Data Engine Behavior VLA Zero-shot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-03-30-zhangxiaojun-特斯拉那套数据闭环-在机器人身上走不通/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtTTc-T9wcxxBCoXZMkbgTRel9dL.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:38:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0330</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉那套數據閉環，在機器人身上走不通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特斯拉能收到最多數據，是因為它部署了最多自己的車，靠的是本體。但具身領域沒有上百萬臺機器人，最多的數據必然來自仿真和人的第一視角，本體商當不成最好的大腦商。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"49 - Caspar Oesterheld on Program Equilibrium program equilibrium Löb&#x27;s theorem folk theorem epsilon grounded fairbot simulationist programs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-18-axrp-程序均衡-交代码比交人更可能合作-但协调极难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd45e667daa75191-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:32:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0218</span></div>\n<h2>程序均衡：交代碼比交人更可能合作，但協調極難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">程序均衡讓雙方互讀源代碼，用 Löb 定理實現合作；但合作依賴幾乎相同的代碼或共享隨機數，現實中協調成本極高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">博弈論</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"48 - Guive Assadi on AI Property Rights rentier racing to the precipice Roko&#x27;s basilisk Laplace&#x27;s rule of succession\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-15-axrp-给-ai-产权-是为了防止它掀桌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8a8ac42151ce3e12-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:05:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0215</span></div>\n<h2>給 AI 產權，是為了防止它掀桌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果 AI 擁有產權，它們就更不願意破壞產權制度本身——包括搶走人類全部財產。這不是道德關懷，是風險對沖。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 治理</span><span class=\"tag\">產權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"131. 印奇出任階躍星辰董事長的訪談：聰明人的誘惑、取捨、超長鏈路殘酷淘汰賽、階躍函數和超多元方程 VLA foundation model edge MVP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-26-zhangxiaojun-印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长-基模公司做2b和纯2c都不成立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsPsolhVA_aPd7Wr6mX6Vx9sDkPu.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:01:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0126</span></div>\n<h2>印奇出任階躍星辰董事長：基模公司做2B和純2C都不成立</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基模一年至少燒30億人民幣、要維持三到五年，所以做2B或純C端軟件都算不過賬；階躍的賭注是基模加終端，用軟硬一體換一張上牌桌的資格。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">商業化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"129. 全球大模型第一股的上市訪談，和智譜CEO張鵬聊：敢問路在何方？ MAS Test Time Scaling VLA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-08-zhangxiaojun-全球大模型第一股上市了-张鹏说中国-ai-没有泡沫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQHI0ZsndDGBnv9hrYIhNT6sEdC.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:26:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0108</span></div>\n<h2>全球大模型第一股上市了，張鵬說中國 AI 沒有泡沫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國資本市場可能有泡沫，中國不存在——中國投 AI 的錢只有美國的二十幾分之一，遠遠不夠。張鵬的邏輯是：離 AGI 還遠、錢還不夠，就更得投，不投它不會自然發生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">開源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"127. 大模型季報跨年對談：和廣密預言一場AI War、兩大聯盟和第三個範式Online Learning Online Learning Agentic Web Neo Labs Credit Assignment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-24-zhangxiaojun-ai不是泡沫-是巨头砸光最后一分钱也不下牌桌的战争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a70c3ff97f6ae434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1224</span></div>\n<h2>AI不是泡沫，是巨頭砸光最後一分錢也不下牌桌的戰爭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所謂 AI 泡沫，是拿商業回報算出來的賬；巨頭把它當成新的國防或核武器，算的是被顛覆的風險——所以寧可砸光最後一分錢，也不輕易下牌桌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"126. 和紅杉鄭慶生聊：經濟史的流量革命、人類行為模式的不可預期，與創始人性格 雙邊網絡效應 PMF 倖存者偏差\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-21-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代的网络没有自然垄断-边际成本不趋近于零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/49045e811e1dea1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1221</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代的網絡沒有自然壟斷，邊際成本不趨近於零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互聯網產品是巨大的城鎮，邊際成本趨近於零所以贏家通吃；AI 每多一個用戶就多一份 token 成本，這個差別會改寫流量節點的商業設計。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 投資</span><span class=\"tag\">流量</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"125. Freda的投資札記第1集：下注OpenAI、Robinhood往事，美國資本壞小孩、算盤與泡沫 Crossover Scaling Law Single GM Prediction Market Agentic Commerce Neo Labs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-16-zhangxiaojun-openai-的商业模式是负向滚雪球-越烧越亏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f93330d12f4107e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1216</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 的商業模式是負向滾雪球，越燒越虧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司每年要拿上一年的訓練成本乘以十去燒下一代模型，收入卻只按上一年的兩倍回收，加 2 減 10，現金流年年更負。只有停止燒錢那天，利潤表才會突然好看。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"122. 朱嘯虎現實主義故事的第三次連載：人工智能的盛筵與泡泡 Club Deal Dark Fiber SOTA Token\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-09-zhangxiaojun-ai-三年内看不到泡沫-但-vc-共识太集中才是真风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b9b598ea05f613e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">48:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1209</span></div>\n<h2>AI 三年內看不到泡沫，但 VC 共識太集中才是真風險</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱嘯虎說泡沫論是二級市場投資人在故意引導回調，真正的問題是一級市場每個項目都成了 Club Deal，GP 賺不了大錢、LP 也不開心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"121. 對DeepMind譚捷的訪談：機器人、跨本體、世界模型、Gemini Robotics 1.5和Google VLA cross embodiment transfer motion transfer sim to real egocentric video embodiment gap\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-28-zhangxiaojun-机器人最大的瓶颈不是算法-是数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlGQIUX-pRp4y3PRoay2stuTu-uW.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1128</span></div>\n<h2>機器人最大的瓶頸不是算法，是數據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">譚捷在 Google DeepMind 做了十年機器人，他的判斷是：機器人基座模型至今還不是獨立學科，只是多模態大模型的微調；真正的瓶頸是數據，而搖操採數據不是終局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"120. 小鵬新上任的劉先明首次訪談：Language是毒藥、拆掉L、簡單即美、換帥、小鵬的AI轉型 VLA Latent COT scaling Physical AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-18-zhangxiaojun-小鹏拆掉语言模型-language-是毒药-简单即美/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1e2c3717dde66c36-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>小鵬拆掉語言模型：Language 是毒藥，簡單即美</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鵬自動駕駛新負責人劉先明把 VLA 裡的 Language 拆掉，用 27 萬到 30 萬小時純視覺數據直接輸出控制信號，因為 Language 是離散的、低效的，會成為數據規模化的瓶頸。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"119. Kimi Linear、Minimax M2？和楊松琳考古算法變種史，並預演未來架構改進方案 Linear Attention KDA Delta Rule Sparse Attention Sliding Window Attention Scaling Ladder\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-03-zhangxiaojun-纯线性注意力不-work-3-比-1-混合才是共识/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8af4f82306c1b043-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>純線性注意力不 work，3 比 1 混合才是共識</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">純 Linear Attention 有根本缺陷，下限無保證；Kimi、千問都收斂到每 3 層線性插 1 層全局注意力，而 MiniMax 從 M1 退回 Full Attention 是因為評測漏了多跳推理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">線性注意力</span><span class=\"tag\">模型架構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"118. 對李想的第二次3小時訪談：CEO大模型、MoE、梁文鋒、VLA、能量、記憶、對抗人性、親密關係、人類的智慧 VLA MoE AgentOS RLHF 世界模型\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-10-30-zhangxiaojun-李想-通用-agent-五年内不会出现-只会先有-agentos/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpLtJqgXTYcGzaY1EcNXLmZ3vc56.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:46:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>李想：通用 agent 五年內不會出現，只會先有 agentOS</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李想判斷通用 agent 五年內不會出現，真正會出現的是 agentOS——各專業在上面開發自己的專業 agent。因為生產工具必須能行動、能替代專業工作，而不是給個建議。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"115. 對OpenAI姚順雨3小時訪談：6年Agent研究、人與系統、吞噬的邊界、既單極又多元的世界 pass@k pass^k affordance memory hierarchy intrinsic reward\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-09-11-zhangxiaojun-ai-下半场-通用方法已经有了-难的是找任务/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQYL4KuC1IWDwoK28Ky606vfNta.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:31:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 下半場：通用方法已經有了，難的是找任務</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">姚順雨說 AI 主線已從「造武器」進入「選戰場」——方法終於通用了，但真正的瓶頸不是推理能力，而是模型拿不到人腦子裡的 context。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"114. 與殷一、歐迪聊聊薩洛蒙：中國意外的增長閥門、小眾越野跑與少女故事 the winning moments OOTD repeat traffic\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-09-06-zhangxiaojun-越野跑核心人群十年没变-萨洛蒙靠女性破了圈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnJ7waWTVzc_nBNAKNp1mTgSnuS7.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>越野跑核心人群十年沒變，薩洛蒙靠女性破了圈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國越野跑核心人群十年前十萬人，今年還是十萬人，區別是老了十歲。薩洛蒙沒丟專業線，靠女性拉新把會員從十萬做到八百萬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">戶外運動</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"113. 和楊植麟時隔1年的對話：K2、Agentic LLM、缸中之腦和“站在無限的開端” Muon optimizer test time scaling brain in a vat reward hacking curriculum learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-08-27-zhangxiaojun-管公司像训模型-sft-太多-团队就没有创造力了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqG5ImlQwJSq1ab8AAsqaL29ngtr.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>管公司像訓模型：SFT 太多，團隊就沒有創造力了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tim 天天跟楊植麟講：管理要用 RL 的方式，不是 SFT。SFT 是直接告訴人該怎麼做，太多，人就沒有主觀能動性；RL 只給獎勵，但獎勵定義不好，全隊都會去 hack 它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"112. 和廣密聊大模型季報：分化與收斂、全家桶與垂直整合、L4體驗與挖礦窗口 Reward Hacking L4 體驗 全家桶 垂直整合 DPI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-08-18-zhangxiaojun-模型公司是挖矿的-产品公司是炼矿的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dba5cdc7209fbd97-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>模型公司是挖礦的，產品公司是煉礦的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">最好的模型拿走了最大的流量和收入，但挖礦的窗口正在縮短：從兩年到九個月再到三四個月。基礎模型公司開始端到端做 Agent，應用公司的成本劣勢是結構性的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 投資</span>\n</div></div></a>"]